            {
                "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                "word": "plénum",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ee633daf-7d51-4b42-a4fe-99e1eff52938",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "plénums"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5cdf3514-ae75-42b0-92dd-feae24e0a708",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "plenum"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02cafc09-9799-3469-8c63-74a3f0257d78",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Session plénière d’une assemblée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e0efb45-1a2f-4fc9-b5f5-e3a0a2294e2d",
                                "sense_id": "02cafc09-9799-3469-8c63-74a3f0257d78",
                                "text": "La candidature de Mikhaïl Gorbatchev au poste de secrétaire général du PC soviétique a été présentée par le ministre des Affaires étrangères d'URSS Andrei Gromyko, au cours d'un plénum extraordinaire qui s'est tenu hier à Moscou, a annoncé l'agence Tass."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abecb684-432f-4ee2-8e56-9d6f745b4689",
                                "sense_id": "02cafc09-9799-3469-8c63-74a3f0257d78",
                                "text": "Le « plénum » du Comité central doit débattre « d’une importante résolution sur les grandes réussites et l’expérience historique des 100 années d’accomplissements du Parti », comme l’a annoncé l’agence Chine nouvelle, sans publier le texte de la résolution."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "93652af3-b1fc-3988-b890-fce876fcde34",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Espace, dans des bâtiments industriels, entre la toiture et le faux-plafond."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5609deb-d7e2-4db2-8a54-11b296d8cd1d",
                                "sense_id": "93652af3-b1fc-3988-b890-fce876fcde34",
                                "text": "La solution des perches depuis le plénum du plafond étant exclue […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6b2636a-a8e4-353c-869d-a99367e0bb85",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Complétion de l’expression existentielle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3448db0f-690a-4f5b-bf6c-74a866d43bc8",
                                "sense_id": "c6b2636a-a8e4-353c-869d-a99367e0bb85",
                                "text": "Ceci signifie que le phainomenon d’existence n’est pas saisissable dans son plenum concret."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "52337c10-7a9b-324c-9fb9-a4195a982c42",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Plénitude pour la jouissance d’un droit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eaa52c87-0c80-48ac-8c3c-d5b3d4c385ab",
                                "sense_id": "52337c10-7a9b-324c-9fb9-a4195a982c42",
                                "text": "Mais comme il lui manquait ce plenum animijudicium qui, d’après la jurisprudence romaine, n’existait qu'à la puberté […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69c912a7-5830-3d0a-b85d-51a9f2ebe466",
                        "entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chambre d’expansion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Cycle du combustible nucléaire",
                            "Technologie des réacteurs nucléaires"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aad76935-1d85-4763-8530-69c0df30476c",
                                "sense_id": "69c912a7-5830-3d0a-b85d-51a9f2ebe466",
                                "text": "Un plénum est aménagé dans la partie supérieure du crayon pour permettre l’expansion des gaz de fission."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "17a78638-d236-43e1-84fd-38e3183ee2ba",
                        "source_entry_id": "09740e02-0539-3762-8309-8846fc59838f",
                        "source_sense_id": "02cafc09-9799-3469-8c63-74a3f0257d78",
                        "source_sense_description": "session plénière",
                        "target_lang_word": "plenum",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plenum",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b05330dd-a7b0-391b-b203-95e82cf9ff4a",
                                        "entry_id": "5a3b1db3-d303-3bb5-8d05-61c81d6e3abf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A space that is completely filled with matter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92c19f28-502b-4b86-8e61-908e1e9a5a40",
                                                "sense_id": "b05330dd-a7b0-391b-b203-95e82cf9ff4a",
                                                "text": "The idea was that a thing could only move into an empty place, and that, in a plenum, there are no empty places."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "265cce1d-703b-43ed-850d-13fda4268ea9",
                                                "sense_id": "b05330dd-a7b0-391b-b203-95e82cf9ff4a",
                                                "text": "The key to understanding medieval interpretations of motion in hypothetically void space is to realize that medieval natural philosophers analyzed the same bodies in the void that they discussed in the plenum of their ordinary world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "522ef952-ae26-3049-8221-500329e9f959",
                                        "entry_id": "5a3b1db3-d303-3bb5-8d05-61c81d6e3abf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of fullness, a great quantity (of something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22ec0962-d8d4-4ba5-b049-308a746b12b0",
                                                "sense_id": "522ef952-ae26-3049-8221-500329e9f959",
                                                "text": "He lay on the long stone slant down to the slapping waves, his denim shorts, sneakers, and socks under his head for a pillow, feeling the splendour of distance in all directions, the liquid silence, the plenum of aloneness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48e6b077-8942-34f5-ac76-fe807e5b4645",
                                        "entry_id": "5a3b1db3-d303-3bb5-8d05-61c81d6e3abf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A legislative meeting (especially of the Communist Party) in which all members are present."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "451c0fc7-d487-3c91-ba14-19273cdff5cc",
                                        "entry_id": "5a3b1db3-d303-3bb5-8d05-61c81d6e3abf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An enclosed space having greater than atmospheric pressure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3fa8e73-4d00-3e34-9486-23f64f21a255",
                                        "entry_id": "5a3b1db3-d303-3bb5-8d05-61c81d6e3abf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The space above a false ceiling used for cables, ducts etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f6be2f1-3fbf-3dd1-89e9-82cdada1111a",
                                        "entry_id": "5a3b1db3-d303-3bb5-8d05-61c81d6e3abf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of network cabling which satisfies plenum-ratings issued by the National Electrical Code. These cables produce less smoke and fumes in the event of fire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
